{"description": "Two rectangular flatbread/pizza slices with melted white cheese, red tomato sauce, sliced red onion, and brown crumbled meat pieces; golden browned crust edges, moderately oily sheen on cheese. Covers roughly 20% of plate, about 1.5 cm thick.", "candidates": ["pizza slice with cheese and sausage", "flatbread pizza with mozzarella and onion", "thin-crust pizza with pepperoni"], "grams": 190},
{"description": "Mixed green salad leaves (frisee/mesclun-style) with some shredded carrot, slivers of cucumber or zucchini, and dark purple-brown leaves; fresh, slightly glossy, moist, with dressing-like sheen. Covers about 20% of plate, mounded moderately.", "candidates": ["mixed greens salad with carrot", "spinach and arugula salad", "mesclun salad with vinaigrette"], "grams": 70},
{"description": "Diced cubes of white cooked poultry with some golden browned edges and light seasoning; moist, fibrous, matte surface. Covers about 12% of plate, piled in a cluster.", "candidates": ["grilled chicken breast cubes", "roasted turkey pieces", "pork tenderloin cubes"], "grams": 110},
{"description": "Small dark glossy kalamata-type olives scattered near the salad, whole and some halved, with slight oily sheen. About 5% of plate.", "candidates": ["kalamata olives", "black olives in brine", "marinated black olives in oil"], "grams": 30},
